# History header column dividers: drag the Message divider, then the Branch / tag divider.
# The pointer moves away after each drag, because the divider color right after a release depends on timing.
fixture demo
wait text "Working Changes"
drag 89 3 80 3
move 100 30
snapshot message-narrow
drag 52 3 46 3
move 100 30
# The color of the header cell under the divider is pressed or hovered, depending on timing.
mask 46 3 2 1
snapshot branch-narrow
